{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11224050","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11224050","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1122405001:1":{"text":"They're all mad at you, Silverbeak!","source_cn":"又是冲着你来的，银喙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33A01CB2EA54E72D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1122405002:1":{"text":"... They said you were going to run away with the money. Is that true?","source_cn":"……他们说你准备卷钱跑路，是真的吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0CBD42FAAB7B9211","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1122405003:1":{"text":"Are you doubting me too, Wildclaw?","source_cn":"连你也要怀疑我吗？！烈爪！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x33EED4362A44683C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1122405004:1":{"text":"It's not that I want to doubt you. But since the start of this camp, several groups of people have come for the same reason!","source_cn":"不是我想怀疑你！可是自从建立了基地，这样的人来了好几拨！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC59165F72E80E1FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1122405005:1":{"text":"Grayhorn left, and just now, you were even counting money! I demand an explanation!","source_cn":"而且你确实抽成了不少钱，老憨也气不过走了！我们需要一个解释！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAACFDF694CC7D17D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1122405006:1":{"text":"Alright... I admit I was counting our money when they showed up.","source_cn":"……好吧。我承认，他们来的时候，我是在清点基地里的钱。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1F3BE6FBD4F5D0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1122405007:1":{"text":"But that's because I've ordered a shipment that needs to be delivered soon. I was getting the payment ready!","source_cn":"但那是因为我订了一批货，马上就要送来了，我得准备好货款！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66EBF448004CC446","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1122405008:1":{"text":"I'm responsible for ordering all the guns, gunpowder, and supplies for the camp. As for what those sand-eaters were saying, that's pure horse crap! I don't owe them anything!","source_cn":"基地里的枪支、火药、物资，全部都是我负责订购的。至于那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1357724A506423FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1122405009:1":{"text":"They're the ones who were racking up debts everywhere. Some merchants with their thugs came to my door and tried to shake me down because of them!","source_cn":"他们在外面赊了那么多账，是那些商人带着打手找上门，硬生...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5E2CD4731CD1E460","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1122405010:1":{"text":"I left so the heat could die down a bit, but when I came back, they were here looking at me like they were going to eat me alive. They were yelling and screaming, claiming that I stole their money! I'm the innocent one here!","source_cn":"我不过出去避避风头，结果回来就看见他们一副要生吞活剥了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9E9D8E119FFF2A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1122405011:1":{"text":"Then why did you give Albert money?","source_cn":"那你为什么要给艾伯特钱？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7ED9AB502444B6BB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1122405012:1":{"text":"He really did lend me money before. I gave him a little bit of interest and put things to rest.","source_cn":"他以前确实借过我钱。我多给了一些，算是利息，也是息事宁人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC94AAEDE3D388C93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1122405013:1":{"text":"What do you think, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","source_cn":"……<style=stress><player_nam...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C530F8A39B9C47A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What do you think, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","female":"What do you think, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","variant_male_record_index":"128620","variant_female_record_index":"128621","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:15:1122405013":{"text":"What do you think, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","source_cn":"……<style=stress><player_name></style>，你觉得呢？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C530F8A39B9C47A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"What do you think, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","female":"What do you think, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>?","variant_male_record_index":"128620","variant_female_record_index":"128621","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1122405014:1":{"text":"Yep, you've always been fair, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","source_cn":"还是你明事理，<style=stress><playe...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4EDDFD810EF4DC1F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Yep, you've always been fair, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","female":"Yep, you've always been fair, <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>.","variant_male_record_index":"128622","variant_female_record_index":"128623","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1122405016:1":{"text":"Well... I'll believe you for now.","source_cn":"既然如此……我也相信你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC81BCF9E64F92988","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1122405017:1":{"text":"Alright, it's time for us to clear out the bandits and recover the caravan's goods.","source_cn":"很好。我们该开始准备清除盗匪，找回商队货物的事了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AF96840B63C23A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1122405018:1":{"text":"Wildclaw has already confirmed the location of the bandit camp, as well as their security detail.","source_cn":"烈爪已经确认了盗匪营地的位置，还有他们内部的守卫情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E68790C80EE9546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1122405019:1":{"text":"According to Wildclaw's observations, now is the time when the guards are the most lax. You two need to seize this moment and go over there right this minute.","source_cn":"按照规律，现在就是他们守卫最松懈的时候。你们两个抓紧时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x577A77E19D395740","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:21:1122405019":{"text":"According to Wildclaw's observations, now is the time when the guards are the most lax. You two need to seize this moment and go over there right this minute.","source_cn":"按照规律，现在就是他们守卫最松懈的时候。你们两个抓紧时间，赶快过去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x577A77E19D395740","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1122405020:1":{"text":"Like I said before, the shipment hasn't arrived yet. I have to wait here for the courier.","source_cn":"我说了，我订的货还没到，得在这里等接线人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC402F75DEFD6EE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1122405021:1":{"text":"Rest assured, that shipment will make completing bounties twice as easy for us.","source_cn":"放心，那批货能让我们的任务——事半功倍。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01546636FD85FAAC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:0:1":{"text":"Just the two of us?","source_cn":"只有我们俩？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC6850C5C4F055433","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Just the two of us?","female":"Just the two of us?","variant_male_record_index":"65090","variant_female_record_index":"65091","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:21:1:2":{"text":"You're not going?","source_cn":"你不去吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8D4F8AC264B5E798","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"You're not going?","female":"You're not going?","variant_male_record_index":"65092","variant_female_record_index":"65093","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:0:1":{"text":"He doesn't seem suspicious.","source_cn":"没什么可疑的","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC38C2A63B475723E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"He doesn't seem suspicious.","female":"He doesn't seem suspicious.","variant_male_record_index":"65084","variant_female_record_index":"65085","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1122405015:1":{"text":"It's not something I can tell you right now, but I guarantee that this shipment will definitely be useful in the future.","source_cn":"很多东西，不方便全都告诉你们，以后肯定能用上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC530D028A76209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:1:2":{"text":"Tell me about the shipment, Silverbeak.","source_cn":"银喙，你订了什么货？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3971162E3FBB9178","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Tell me about the shipment, Silverbeak.","female":"Tell me about the shipment, Silverbeak.","variant_male_record_index":"65086","variant_female_record_index":"65087","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:15:2:3":{"text":"Let's trust him for now.","source_cn":"姑且相信他吧","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xD90663FC2B7E1C07","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Let's trust him for now.","female":"Let's trust him for now.","variant_male_record_index":"65088","variant_female_record_index":"65089","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:烈爪":{"text":"Wildclaw","source":"烈爪","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:银喙":{"text":"Silverbeak","source":"银喙","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":29,"localized_text_count":28,"speaker_count":2}}